block content
    h1 Depression
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/depression/symptoms-causes/syc-20356007") Mayo Clinic]:
    blockquote Depression is a mood disorder that causes a persistent feeling of sadness and loss of interest. Also called major depressive disorder or clinical depression, it affects how you feel, think and behave and can lead to a variety of emotional and physical problems. You may have trouble doing normal day-to-day activities, and sometimes you may feel as if life isn't worth living.
